At that time, the doctors examined and told that the baby was overdue and refused to be born, and the health was not very good, it was very bad, if the birth was not good, it required surgery, if not surgery, his baby might lose his life.
After hearing this, the family agreed to perform the operation, and the doctor signed a contract with the thumbprint and handed over the $ 650 surgery fee. At 12 noon, he entered the operating room for about 20 minutes. To half an hour is ready.
Nath said that after an hour of surgery to remove the baby, his daughter began to suffer from severe abdominal pain, he and his family asked because they were worried about her daughter's condition. Follow up, surgery is always painful like this.
He also asked for her son to be sent to a more specialized hospital, but the doctor said that he would follow up and claim that his daughter was born with cellulite until 6 pm the same day, she was getting worse and worse. "If my daughter has any problems, I will complain to the doctor," he said. Only then did the doctor call an ambulance from Preah Kosomak Hospital (Lok Sang Hospital) to take his daughter to the emergency room with a doctor.
But when the doctor arrived, he left his child behind and disappeared. As for Dr. Kosomak, he told her that his daughter had a lot of blood splashing into her uterus, which caused her to choke and have more blood vessels. Abandoned once to escape death, but died on one side of the body and have a memory disorder like a 2-year-old child.
The father said that for nine days, he had never seen the doctors and the owner of the hospital and the maternity hospital "Sovandy Chom Chao" ignore him for questioning or see, now he asked to be responsible, but the teacher The doctors refused.
