Shocking! A 2-year-old boy fell off a bridge and fell into a river, his mother disappeared and cried, almost having a heart attack in Takhmao City, Kandal Province.
(Central): A shocking incident occurred when a mother was riding a motorbike taxi to her 2-year-old son on the bridge over the river, but unfortunately the bicycle slipped and the baby fell into the river, while the mother cried and almost had a heart attack. . As of the morning of May 20, 2020, no child victims have been found.
The incident happened on the evening of May 19 at the bridge under construction from Sangkat Sitbo to Sangkat Koh Anlong Chen in Sitbo Village, Sangkat Sitbo, Takhmao City, Kandal Province.
According to the police, the father, Srem Sroy, 27, and the mother, Meas Srey Net, 19, currently live in the same commune.
On the day of the incident, the mother of the child victim took a motorbike taxi from her house across the bridge to Koh Anlong Chen to bring rice to Tai Kong Lan because she was the cook. Halfway through the bridge, the motorcycle slipped and fell, causing the child to fall into the river.
