From March until the beginning of April, Cambodia has identified 19 cases of 19 cases of Kovid. Of those 19 cases of Kovid, 51 were Cambodians and 71 were foreigners. Foreigners diagnosed with 19 cases of Kovid in Cambodia include China, the United States, Britain, France, Canada, Belgium, Malaysia, Indonesia and Vietnam.
Although Cambodia has not yet gone through the risks and stages of Kovid 19 infection, the virus that causes fear and turmoil in the world, the treatment of patients is completely safe. The patient's life is a proud and happy success.
Contrary to the pessimistic assessments of these groups, Cambodia has received rave reviews and accolades from the World Health Organization (WHO) in Cambodia regarding the implementation of realistic measures and measures. Clear and timely to respond to the prevention, control and fight against Kovid 19.
In addition, the group of countries that are proud to be the countries with advanced health care, full of modern technology, have been severely affected by the Kovid attacks, 19 lives, tens of thousands of people have been infected and tens of thousands more have been lost. Life.
As of the morning of May 16, 19 Kovid has been spreading and attacking 213 countries and territories. Nearly 5 million people were infected, more than 300,000 died and more than 1.7 million were treated. The countries with the highest number of Kovid cases and deaths 19 have advanced health care systems and are also economic powers.
The five countries with the highest number of cases and deaths from 19 cases of Kovid are still active: the United States, followed by Spain, Russia, the United Kingdom and Italy.
Kovid 19 is a new infectious disease for which there is no definitive vaccine or cure. Therefore, the ability to treat this disease does not depend on the country with strong health sector or the country with poor health sector, that is, the technique of treating this disease is only at a similar level.
But what is effective in the fight against this new disease is the introduction of measures and measures in a timely manner to prevent the disease from spreading.
For the United States and some other Western countries, the epidemic that has led to these epidemics is almost non-existent, an insult to the situation and an insult to the effects of the disease.
Italy was the first European country to suffer from 19 cases of Kovid. Starting from people who despise and insult Kovid 19 as having no power to attack their health, making them disobedient and disobedient to the measures as well as the guidelines of the state and experts, and continue to travel and Rally eventually makes the disease the most serious attack.
Apart from Italy, other European countries, including the United States, not only are the people underestimating the spread of Kovid 19, even the leaders of these countries do not seem clear and realistic in their control and leadership. Fighting this disease as well. They are still confused and do not know which is more important, the choice between keeping the economy running and preventing the spread of Kovid 19?
The leaders of these countries, fearing the impact on the country's economy, are still reluctant to decide to close the country and travel to curb the spread of the disease, even though the disease has already invaded the country. Because of the reluctance and reluctance to decide whether to choose measures to block the country or to keep the economy afloat, the epidemic of Kovid 19 has been devastated.
For Cambodia, those who do not give much advantage and encouragement to the leadership of the Royal Government, it can be said that the fact that Cambodia is less epidemic due to the small population and climate problems that help. Prevent the spread of Kovid 19 disease.
However, according to the statistics of the countries that are affected by the 19 cases of Kovid in the world, it shows that the outbreak of 19 cases of Kovid is not limited to small countries, small population or climate. Because countries with warmer climates than Cambodia, such as Africa and countries with smaller populations than Cambodia, also have much higher rates of infection than Cambodia.
When we look at this aspect, we can see that Cambodia's ability to control and prevent the spread of Kovid 19 is not a simple matter or a matter of fate. The best result is the realism and clarity in the leadership, management and administration of the Royal Government.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Prime Minister of Cambodia and the Commander-in-Chief of the Battle of Kovid 19, has carefully monitored and evaluated these measures before taking any precautionary measures.
The leader, a veteran and commander of the Forgotten War, is known as a commander who never looked down on the enemy or despised the battlefield for this reason. Let this commander fight to win almost every battle. This experience also reminded the Supreme Commander not to be underestimated and neglected in the battlefield of the war against Kovid 19 as well.
In order to fight and prevent the spread of Kovid 19, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Cambodia's outstanding leader, responded immediately by launching a number of necessary measures, such as the decision to establish a National Commission that brings together members from all ministries and institutions. Sub-national authority, headed by Samdech himself, to order the work.
In addition to the National Commission, the Prime Minister also has another Inter-Ministerial Commission, which is directly responsible for combating and preventing the spread of Kovid 19. This inter-ministerial commission is chaired by the Minister of Health, Mr. Mam Bunheng, and consists of all ministries and institutions.
Dissemination education on Kovid 19 prevention and prevention measures has been widely produced and disseminated through social media and social media, as well as live outreach in people's villages by national teams.
