Collectively, the management, management and implementation of clear and rigorous measures of the head of the Royal Government of Cambodia, as well as the careful implementation of officials from all ministries and institutions, especially officials of the Ministry of Health and doctors in the army. Those in the front and back lines are a good result for Cambodia to prevent the spread of Kovid 19 disease.
This pleasant result is also inseparable from the participation of the entire Cambodian people, that is, the Cambodian people, the good people, have complied with the regulations and guidelines of the Royal Government and professional officials by strictly following the rules of hygiene. In disease prevention.
