In response to Amnesty International's claim that "the fight against drugs is a war on drugs in Cambodia", General Mak Chito confirmed that there is no war on drugs in Cambodia. In Cambodia, under the leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, there was no organization of a war on drugs that could endanger human life.
He said that since the anti-drug campaign in 2017 until now, no one has died from this campaign.
