This emphasis was made by Lt. Gen. Thet on the morning of May 14, 2020, on the occasion of the General's meeting with officials of the Traffic Bureau and traffic officers from the 14 district inspectors who attended. A total of 728 people (divided into 4 different shifts) to disseminate the experimental meeting on the implementation of traffic law enforcement by General Santibandit Neth Savoeun, National Police Commissioner.
