The change of the new Board of Directors in the second mandate is in accordance with the rules of Prince Real Estate (Cambodia) Group, with the need to vote to change the members of the Board of Directors on a regular basis, as well as to change the new management structure and strength. To the senior management of Prince Real Estate (Cambodia) Group and to be ready to enter the market in the future.
