1: All authorities when driving a motorcycle must have a license plate, must wear a helmet and must not talk on the phone while driving 2: For the authorities who drive a car must have a license plate must wear a seat belt and must not talk on the phone while driving 3 : In case the driving authority violates the traffic law, it will be fined according to the law equally with the general population.
