(Phnom Penh): The Ministry of Public Works and Transport, one of the ministries of the Royal Government of Cambodia, is seen to greatly modernize its services by connecting with technology systems. By modernizing in conjunction with this technology system, the Ministry's service delivery is improved and faster.
