In this meeting, Mr. Sun Chanthol highlighted that the use of information technology of the Industrial Revolution 4.0 to provide public services efficiently and transparently. Achievements in public services in connection with the technology system achieved by the Ministry include: automation system, vehicle registration, vehicle technical inspection, ROAD CARE Mobile App, as well as road traffic law awareness program.
