This important meeting was held at Tbong Khmum Provincial Hall with the participation of Provincial Councilors, Provincial Board of Governors, Director-Deputy Director of Provincial Administration, Director-Deputy Director of Provincial Office, Provincial Court, Chairman-Deputy Chairman. Departments around the province and many other relevant officials.
The meeting took place on four agendas, including:
1: Review and approve the draft minutes of the 11th ordinary meeting of the third mandate of Tbong Khmum Provincial Council, 2: Review and approve the draft progress report for April 2020 of Tbong Khmum Provincial Administration, 3: Review and discuss And approved the draft instruction on the process of preparing the construction of the three-year rolling investment program (2021-2023) of Tbong Khmum Provincial Administration 4: Other issues.
After reading the draft of the above three reports, which was submitted to the meeting for joint discussion, it was approved by the Chairman and the members of the Provincial Council by raising their hands in favor by 25 out of 25 votes.
Mr. Sak Leng said that the current meeting is very important for the preparation of documents for the special meeting is to find out the shortcomings by all members who participated in the meeting to improve. Better to keep good documents, both spelling, phrases and meaningful content in line with the original sample documents.
The Chairman of Tbong Khmum Provincial Council also proposed to properly prepare the meeting calendar in accordance with the summary report at both the provincial and district levels in order to facilitate the preparation of documents faster and better. .
Speaking at the meeting, Mr. Cheam Chansophoan praised and appreciated all stakeholders who have worked hard in the past, especially the leaders in the provincial council, who helped promote the work of the Tbong Khmum Provincial Administration to achieve good results. Continuous improvement.
In addition, Mr. Cheam Chansophoan also requested the administration of the provincial hall, relevant departments, units after receiving suggestions in the meeting related to the challenges, as well as other requests to visit and report to him no later than 1 Week to find a solution in time, as well as to respond to the provincial council meeting at the next meeting.
