A man cut down a big tree and it died tragically in Sesan district, Stung Treng province
(Stung Treng): A man went to cut down a big tree in his relatives' farm, but the tree collapsed and died on the spot.
This incident happened on May 11, 2020 yesterday at Thmor Dar, Sdao village, Sdao commune, Sesan district, Stung Treng province.
The cause of death was that the victim came to help cut down the relatives' plantation located at the scene, and when the big tree felled, it collapsed and died.
