A kind of wild plant grape is used to make a delicious dish.
(Stung Treng): A wild plant called grapefruit, when it starts to grow at the beginning of the rainy season, is cut by the locals to cook and sell in the market.
Many years ago, people did not seem to be interested in this wild vegetable, but now grapes have become a special food on the market. Prickly pears are found growing in perennial forests in forested provinces such as Stung Treng, Ratanakkiri, Mondulkiri and Preah Vihear.
Fresh News interviewed a villager in Stung Treng province and they said that at the beginning of the rainy season, one or two rains in the forest make the natural resources of biodiversity grow. The prickly pear trees are changing according to the natural season and are used by the locals to cook.
The village said that we can use grapefruit as a food, such as making onlak, spicy water, prahok with fried grapes, used as a soup, soup, coconut paste, pork legs, pickled pickles and so on.
The Chinese Embassy in Cambodia confirmed on its Facebook page on May 12, 2020 that the 19 new Kovid disease prevention and control materials provided by the Chinese government to Cambodia include: 50,016 virus test kits for 18,000 pieces of protective clothing, 30,000 goggles and 200 thermometers.
The Chinese embassy confirmed that the materials would be received by the Ministry of Health. The Chinese ambassador also confirmed that China will continue to provide assistance in the form of protective clothing, masks and other materials to provide support in the fight against the virus in Cambodia.
It should be noted that in the spirit of friendship and help in times of adversity, the Chinese government, army, civil society organizations and the Chinese private sector have joined forces with the Royal Government of Cambodia to fight Kovid 19. Both the government, the military, civil society organizations and the Chinese private sector have provided 19 items to prevent and combat Kovid.
In addition to providing equipment for the prevention and fight against Kovid 19, the Chinese government has also sent a team of doctors to exchange experiences with Cambodian doctors in the fight against Kovid 19.
