According to the police, the owner of the house is M. Pov, an agent of Kampuchea Thmey newspaper in Banteay Meanchey province, living in O'Ambel village, Sangkat O'Ambel, Serey Sophorn city, Banteay Meanchey province.
According to Mr. Em Pov, before the incident, the fire came out of the upper floor for a while, then the fire was full. At the same time, neighbors helped remove the property from the fire and sprayed water, but due to the full fire can not spray water.
Mr. Em Pov further stated that the property in the house was completely burnt down, amounting to more than 50,000 US dollars, in which the authorities concluded that the fire may have damaged the power line.
