The arrival of the King of Cambodia and the Queen Mother of the Khmer nation was accompanied by the royal family, officials of the Royal Palace and the leaders of the nation's top institutions.
It should be noted that the King of Cambodia and the Queen Mother of Cambodia traveled to Beijing to check the health of the King according to the prescription of Chinese doctors on April 1, 2020.
During their stay at the Royal Palace in Beijing, China, the Cambodian King and Queen Mother received the highest level of attention from the medical team and the leadership. The King of Cambodia was also willing to allow senior Chinese officials and leaders to meet with him to inquire about his health, as well as to hold some work hearings.
In fact, on May 8, he welcomed Wang Yi, State Councilor and Minister of Foreign Affairs of the People's Republic of China, to visit the King and ask him about his health.
During the meeting, the King of Cambodia and Mr. Wang Yi raised a number of issues related to the traditional and close relations between Cambodia and China over the past 60 years.
Wang Yi emphasized during the hearing that Cambodia-China relations are an inseparable friendship. The Chinese diplomat added that the friendship between Cambodia and China is a friendship that has withstood the test of international exchange and is a model of changing relations between countries.
The King of Cambodia also expressed his willingness to continue to work hard to maintain and strengthen the ties left by the Cambodian Father, Samdech Norodom Sihanouk, and the previous generation of Chinese leaders to become stronger and stronger to provide better benefits. More to the people of both countries.
He expressed his firm belief that Cambodia-China relations would be further strengthened and people-to-people friendship would continue to deepen.
During the hearing, the King of Cambodia also exchanged views and views on the Kovid 19 epidemic with Wang Yi.
The Cambodian monarch was amazed and appreciated the actions of the Chinese leadership in combating and preventing the spread of Kovid 19. He also thanked the Chinese leadership for providing cooperation and providing more facilities to Cambodia in the fight against Kovid 19.
Please be reminded that the King of Cambodia and the Queen Mother of Cambodia always visit the Royal Health in Beijing, China twice a year according to the prescription of Chinese doctors.
