2: Private general education institutions (primary to secondary school) and kindergarten * Postpone re-enrollment until further notice * Continue to implement "distance learning and e-learning" measures as In particular, the directive dated 13 April 2020 on the promotion of distance learning and electronic learning by private educational institutions at all levels * Regularly clean the campus.
