Serey Sophorn Mayor Inspects Frog Raising in Phneat Commune
(Banteay Meanchey): Mr. Hul Raya, Governor of Serey Sophorn City, together with the Municipal Council, on May 08, 2020, inspected the frog raising of farmers in Kantuot Village, Phneat Sangkat, Serey Sophorn City.
