* First: The senior leaders of the armies of the two countries should be determined together and careful ... etc. He will continue to communicate closely with Samdech.
* Second, if implemented this year, you would like to propose a meeting to prepare a military commission between China and Cambodia, the Chinese side is willing to prepare for the Cambodian side, hope that the Cambodian side will study and respond to the Chinese side.
* Third, the Cambodian side should take Kovid 19 as a good opportunity to strengthen cooperation in the field of health, raise the level of strategic cooperation. In the coming days, China will continue to focus on the development of medical vaccines in China, and if there are concrete results in the field of vaccines, he will inform immediately.
Fourth, the Chinese side has included some projects in the military sector this year, for example, the IT project, the Ministry of National Defense building to compete with ASEAN institutional standards, navy, air force, military police, the Chinese side will wait for the epidemic situation. Kovid-19 is a little relieved, the Chinese side will send experts to Cambodia to participate in the implementation.
