Chip Mong Bank enters digital banking market
(Phnom Penh): Digital banking services are growing rapidly in the banking sector to provide convenience, speed and high security to customers, as well as facilitate major financial transactions through digital systems, especially mobile phones.
Chip Mong Bank is launching digital banking services to make it easier for customers to make important financial transactions via mobile.
In addition to the existing digital banking services, Chip Mong Bank is also an official member of the "Bakong" electronic payment system.
The benefits that Chip Mong Bank customers can get from this electronic payment system include sending and receiving money anytime and anywhere, fast scanning and payment at 300 more "Bakong" stores and sending money to Hold "Bakong" members quickly and free of charge.
Chip Mong Bank will continue to develop and provide a wide range of banking services to meet the financial needs of its customers. The Cambodian Red Cross would like to thank the Bank for Investment and Development of Cambodia Plc. BIDC for donating $ 30,000 to the Cambodian Red Cross for May 8, 2020
