Two military officers include:
* First: Sok Bunsoeun, male, 63 years old, Cambodian, military occupation, was sentenced by a military court to 16 years in prison * Second: Rath Chanmony, alias Chey Moeun, male, 47 years old, Cambodian, military occupation was The court sentenced him to 16 years in prison.
Both men were charged with: Illegal formation of the armed forces without permission and without permission from the legal authorities in Kampong Chhnang, Kampong Speu and Phnom Penh between 2016 and June 2018. Provided for punishment under Article 463 of the Penal Code.
Following the announcement of the military court verdict, the two former military officers will be removed from the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces (RCAF) from the day the final verdict is officially announced.
It should be noted that in 2016, 244 people were deceived by the two former soldiers to be included in the framework of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces in exchange for the money they set.
