At present, the body of Duke Prit Moha Upasika Thomman Vivathana Bun Seangly is kept at the house of Samdech Techo Prime Minister near the Independence Monument in Phnom Penh. On May 5, 2020, leaders in the top institutions of the nation and from various ministries were allowed to burn incense to pay their respects.
