The food items delivered to the families of the veterans on that occasion included: Each family received 3 bottles of fish sauce, 3 bottles of soy sauce, 5 cans of fish, 10 cans of noodles, 1 small bottle of alcohol, 2 scarves, 10 kg of rice and a budget. 50,000 Riels. There are also donations from the association, including: 3 bottles of fish sauce, 3 bottles of soy sauce and 5 packets of noodles.
