Philanthropist donates 19 Kovid protective equipment to Police Department of Identity Card
(Phnom Penh): Philanthropists and General Director of the Top Beauty Magic Company, led by Ms. Sot Sovannda, Advisor to Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of Interior, provided 500 bottles of SPRAY and 2,000 masks and antiseptic equipment. Some 19 Kovids were given to the police of the Department of Identity of Khmer Citizenship to be used for Kovid 19 virus protection and other hygiene.
Ms. Sot Sovannda, Advisor to Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng, stated that the material she collected from these charities was to join the Royal Government in the prevention and control of Kovid 19 virus in accordance with the guidelines of the Ministry of Health. Sharing in the name of humanity as well.
At the same time, Ms. Sot Sovannda also promised that she will try to raise more charities to continue to help the Royal Government as much as possible, and this help will take place in the near future. Dr. Kun Nhem brought some materials and equipment for the prevention of Kovid 19 to distribute to some schools and units in Kien Svay district
(Phnom Penh): On May 04, 2020, Dr. Kun Nhim, First Vice-Chairman of the Standing Committee of the Central Working Group, visited Kien Svay District, accompanied by a number of leaders and subordinates, including the Chairman, Vice-Chairman and members of the Central Working Group. The eight communes of Kien Svay district donated some materials and equipment to help prevent the spread of a new type of respiratory disease caused by the coronavirus.
These donations were distributed to Kien Svay District Party Committees, 8 commune parties, district referral hospitals, 8 commune health centers, 3 high schools and 5 secondary schools of the Armed Forces (Police and Gendarmerie) of the district. Kien Svay. The donation included 40 cans of alcohol (equivalent to 1,200 liters), 19,500 tablets, 13 thermometers, 50 sets of antiseptic medical clothing and 50 pairs of gloves.
The Apsara Authority has been busy renovating the area here to show off to tourists after being cured of Kovid 19.
