(Siem Reap): Consumer Protection, Competition and Anti-Fraud Branch Officer (Siem Reap) in Siem Reap Province on the morning of May 4, 2020, in collaboration with the Provincial Department of Commerce and the Phsar Leu Authority. Check for non-compliance with food products at Phsar Leu, located in Sangkat Slor Kram, Siem Reap City, Siem Reap Province, by identifying 14 samples of high-risk food items for analysis.
