Charitable donations to support doctors and medical professionals through the Ministry of Health include 3,600 liters of antiseptic alcohol, 4,000 masks and other corporate drinks totaling $ 36,600. To fight and prevent the spread of Kovid-19 in Cambodia under the Oishi Green Tea Campaign to take care of Cambodia.
