(Banteay Meanchey): A violent explosion between a group of hippies and Poipet police led to the explosion of about 10 weapons, causing a man to die while a police officer was seriously injured at 01:20 past midnight. Third, May 2020.
Residents at the scene said he was asleep as usual when he heard gunshots, he and his children got up, heard screams and arguments, and after a while heard gunshots. He fired his shotgun until a motorcycle struck a stone table in front of his house.
The case of violence to the point of loss of life occurred at the point of Standard Nguon Road, the border road of Palilei 2 Village and Kilo 4 Village, Sangkat Phsar Kandal, Poipet City, Banteay Meanchey Province.
Brigadier General Sithi Loh confirmed that the specialized force has been conducting a thorough search of the scene. So far, the team does not know the cause of this case is still researching.
