In Cambodia, although Kovid 19 caused serious economic disadvantages, it was seen that it contributed to the digitalization of the public and private sectors in accordance with the wishes of the Royal Government of Cambodia. Also.
The Prime Minister of Cambodia, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, has always expressed his desire to create an e-government that integrates digital systems and uses more technology to increase efficiency and provide services to the people faster.
