Heng Vanda sees the Kovid 19 pandemic as an opportunity for Cambodia to digitally develop its education sector. He said that teaching online can cause some obstacles at first for Cambodian students because it is new.
But the president of the Higher Education Association sees that with some guidance from parents, all students can adapt to the new educational environment and also help students understand digital work patterns and gain access to them. New digital wisdom as well.
Online study Some time after Cambodia faced the Kovid 19 crisis, it was observed that many Cambodian students began to develop and acquire new knowledge without realizing it: understanding and computer skills, using other related programs Study, including researching lessons online.
