(Kampong Chhnang): The project to build a new prison building in Kampong Chhnang province has already started on 15 hectares of land located in Trapeang Ta Sok village, Prey Moul commune, Rolea Bier district, more than 10 kilometers from the provincial town.
Mr. Chhour Chandoeun, Governor of Kampong Chhnang Province, and government officials in the province held a groundbreaking ceremony to build a new prison at the above point on the morning of April 30, 2020 yesterday.
Pov Vuthy, director of Kampong Chhnang Provincial Prison, said that according to the Kampong Chhnang provincial administration's plan, a new prison would be built on 10 hectares of land. The other 5 hectares will be used to build a drug rehabilitation center, which is a good project for the people of Kampong Chhnang.
