(Phnom Penh): Cambodia expects to receive more tourists from China first when the world gets rid of Kovi 19, while the Chinese tourism market is a big market for Cambodia and Cambodia is ready to receive visitors. Tourists come from this great country as well.
This is according to Mr. Thong Khon, Minister of Tourism, after the meeting with the private sector in the tourism sector on finding solutions to the impact of tourism in the Kovid 19 era on April 30, 2020 at the Ministry of Tourism.
Minister Thong Khon said that the Chinese tourism market is a large market that will recover first in some international destinations (safe destinations).
The Minister also instructed all specialized departments of the Ministry of Tourism to increase the readiness to receive Chinese tourists in accordance with the "China Ready" and to encourage tourism businesses and destinations to further implement health safety measures. Of tourists and citizens absolutely.
In addition, once the Ministry of Tourism achieves a new standard for tourism business, all tourism businesses must adhere to the new standard to prevent people and tourists from being infected with Kovid-19.
