(Banteay Meanchey): A deaf victim was drunk by an acquaintance who worked with him and then robbed and killed a motorcycle and a chain, and even more brutally, the perpetrator also snatched his golden teeth. Victims as well. However, this brutal murder was immediately launched by the police force to arrest 5 perpetrators (a woman).
This horrific incident happened in a hut in the middle of a field in Otakol village, Russey commune, Mongkul Borei district, Banteay Meanchey province on April 28, 2020.
According to the story, the five perpetrators persuaded the victim to drink wine in a hut in the middle of a field in Otakoul village, Russey Kok commune, Mongkul Borei district. At that time, the five perpetrators had the idea to ask the victim to drink Drunk more.
After that, they left the above location to a bridge on the way to Siem Reap province and continued to make the victim drink more and more. Victims immersed in canal water.
At that time, the perpetrator immersed the victim to death and the perpetrator also hit the victim's golden teeth.
After that, the five perpetrators prepared to transport the bodies of the victims on a motorbike by 4 people (3 perpetrators and the victims) and dumped the bodies in a canal in Sangkat Makak, Serey Sophorn City on National Road 56. .
The perpetrator also escaped from Mongkul Borei district to hide the location of a woman, the wife of one of the four perpetrators in Kamrek village, Svay Sor commune, Boribo district, Kampong Chhnang province. Recently, the provincial police force led by Major General Atkham, the provincial commissioner, cracked down.
The five suspects are currently being processed by specialized forces.
