Speaking to reporters after this morning's meeting, Ms. Chou Bun Eng said that during the 19-crisis Kovid crisis, there was a shortage of migrant workers and the Royal Government was working with NGOs to address the issue by providing Social protection for them. The social protection system will be implemented from the end of May or the beginning of June 2020.
