This is the third time that the Chinese Ministry of National Defense has provided medical equipment for the prevention of Kovid-19 to the Cambodian Ministry of National Defense and further demonstrated the iron brotherly friendship between the two armies. A firm decision to join hands in the fight against Kovid-19.
Although Kovid-19 is spreading around the world, people are moving away from each other, but the morale of the two armies and the two countries, Cambodia and China, is getting closer and closer, and our hands are getting stronger.
When China was in the most difficult time, Cambodian friends immediately provided assistance. 80 days ago, a plane landed at Beijing Capital International Airport, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Prime Minister of the Kingdom of Cambodia, paid an urgent visit to China, provided strong support to China in terms of politics and morale. The practical process of presenting the core content of the Chinese-Cambodian Common Destiny Community.
Samdech Pich Sena Tea Banh, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of National Defense, said that the Cambodian side strongly supports China in the fight against Kovid-19 and also firmly believes that the Chinese government, army and people are capable enough to overcome The fight against Kovid-19 disease.
Kovid-19, as well as orders to carry out full missions, the Chinese military has strictly adhered to the policies of the CPC Central Committee and the CPC Central Military Commission, and has made significant contributions to the victory in the war to prevent and control the disease. .
On January 24, the Chinese military sent the first medical team from all over China to support Wuhan. The Chinese military has bravely assigned more than 4,000 medical staff to prepare beds for 2,856 beds and treat 7,198 infected people.
Whether it is wind or rain, we must be united. The virus does not discriminate on the basis of race or nationality. Only by supporting each other can the light of success come quickly.
Kovid-19 has boosted health and medical cooperation between the Cambodian and Chinese armies, while other areas have not been disrupted, reflecting the high strategic trust and deepening practical cooperation between the two armies. Two.
Kovid-19 has not gone away, the situation is still serious, the two countries' armies have heavy responsibilities and a long way to go. Sule Cambodia, Sule China. Fight for the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces. Fight for the Chinese People's Liberation Army.
