(Phnom Penh): Dr. Hang Chuon Naron, Minister of Education, Youth and Sports, on April 28, 2020, sent a letter to the Head of the Unit under the Ministry and the Director of the Capital-Provincial Department of Education on the temporary suspension of the transfer. Civil servants and teachers in the field of education, youth and sports to various ministries and institutions.
