Dr. Hang Chuon Naron stated that the temporary suspension of the recruitment of new civil servants for 2020 will make the education, youth and sports sectors face a greater shortage of teachers.
In this regard, the Ministry of Education, Youth and Sports would like to introduce to all units under the supervision of the Ministry and all Departments of Education, Youth and Sports of the Capital and Provinces as follows:
