(Phnom Penh): Oknha Pharmacist Dr. Hay Ly Eang, President of PPM Pharmaceutical Enterprise, said that strengthening the independence of the local pharmaceutical industry is the most important thing for Cambodia to solve the urgent problems that Cambodia faces. As of now, Cambodia and the world are experiencing the problem of Kovid 19.
The tycoon continued that Cambodia has organized the process of production of this drug since the early 1990s, which is the goal of making Cambodia independent in the production of this drug. In the field of pharmaceutical production for PPM, with our support, we can supply between 60-70% of the market in terms of quality, international and local standards, but currently the supply of medicines in Cambodia is only 10% due to the people's lack of faith and Assistance.
Mr. Oknha added that in terms of production capacity, we can produce all of Cambodia, capable of supplying local demand, which is cheap and best for the poor, but because they do not understand the field of medicine. So they believe in foreign products more than local products.
"Kovid 19 has shown that in these difficult circumstances, if Cambodia does not have access to health care, especially in medicine, it is clear that Cambodia is at high risk," he said. "That Cambodia can be self-reliant and independent of the local pharmaceutical industry."
He added that Cambodia has the ability to manage and develop the pharmaceutical sector on its own, and also an opportunity to show that Cambodia is a productive country of international quality medicine.
Mr. Oknha stated that until now, PPM has been present in Cambodia for more than 20 years, and the factors that lead PPM Pharmaceutical Enterprise to be strong and successful depend on factors such as: transparency, capacity that motivates us. Establish higher standards and international recognition, trust and so on. Always wear a helmet when driving! 4 killed, 8 injured in road accidents nationwide on April 27
