(Svay Rieng): A family living in Tapov village, Sangkat-Bavet city, Svay Rieng province, Ms. Nhim Phal Lay, 50 years old, and her family still insist that the relevant leaders and ministries address and provide reasonable compensation at market value after the authorities A large cross section cuts through the center of her residential land.
In connection with the protest, Bavet City Governor Lim Seang Heng said that the provincial committee was working with the Ministry of Economy on a road and drainage system.
As for Mr. Hem Piseth, Deputy Governor of Svay Rieng Province, he told Fresh News that the construction of the sewer system in Bavet City was due to the request of the landowners, which was too high to be resolved, and more than 100 families agreed. All that was left was his family, who had not yet agreed, and now this was settled.
He said, "In this case, the provincial governor also coordinated as much as possible. If this project is delayed, it will affect the big project. The working group has already resolved for his family a budget of 80,000 to 90,000 dollars, but they do not agree." "
In response to the above statement of Svay Rieng provincial leaders, Ms. Nhim Phal Lay could not accept that. She considers the allegations to be untrue because the impact that the deputy governor mentioned was that more than 100 families were affected on state-owned roads. In particular, the impact is on her private property, which has solid structures on the land as rooms for rent and fences.
She said that the team paid her only three times: the first time on April 3, 2020 (survey), the second time on April 17, 2020 and the third final solution. On April 24, 2020 at Svay Rieng Provincial Hall. At that time, the representative of the Ministry of Finance and Mr. Hem Piseth asked her and her family to accept at once the price of 80,564.13 US dollars and told that there was no change in this price and that there would be no regrets.
The price she submitted to Svay Rieng Provincial Hall on March 27, 2020, the provincial hall did not respond to her and her family, thinking that the previous price was too expensive, but she thought This price is just the price and she is also willing and flexible to add to this price, so she and her family, please be affordable and fair will be acceptable.
