200 Tons of Rice Donated by Senior Minister Kun Kim
(Oddar Meanchey): About 200 tons of rice was distributed by Senior Minister Kun Kim, Chairman of the Oddar Meanchey Provincial Assistance Team, to people suffering from Kovid 19 disease in Oddar Meanchey province. In addition to rice, about 10,000 krama of canned fish, fish sauce and soy sauce with a total budget of more than one billion riels were also given to the needy people.
