(Preah Vihear): A man died after getting into a car to bring his family back home, but the wrong gear, the brakes caused the car to fall into the pool and drowned when taken to the hospital.
This incident happened on Saturday afternoon, April 25, 2020 in Moha Phal village, Chhean Mok commune, Tbeng Meanchey district, Preah Vihear province.
According to a report from the Chhean Mok Commune Administration Post, before the incident, a family was driving a Hybrid car with license plate Phnom Penh 2Q-3877 to relax in the upper area near the pond. In one place, there is also a preparation for drinking alcohol.
After drinking alcohol, the husband drove his car in order to bring his wife and children back home, but because he was too drunk, he stepped on the wrong gear and mistakenly jumped into the pool, but luckily The wife and children have not yet entered the car. Meanwhile, the husband was trapped in the car, causing him to choke to death after being taken to the 16th of January Referral Hospital in Preah Vihear Province.
According to the report, the victim was named Chhuon Chhean, 45 years old, living in the village of Duty, Sangkat Pal Hal, Preah Vihear City, Preah Vihear Province.
