(Banteay Meanchey): Deputy Prime Minister Ke Kim Yan, Chairman of the National Authority for Combating Drugs and Chairman of the Royal Government Working Group visited Banteay Meanchey province on April 24, 2020, chaired a meeting to inspect the reservoir for cultivation and promotion. Farming in Banteay Meanchey province.
Receiving recommendations and indications from Deputy Prime Minister Ke Kim Yan, Mr. Oum Rath, Governor of Banteay Meanchey Province, made a report on the progress of the work by assigning two provincial working groups: the Agriculture Working Group to inspect the reservoirs for cultivating and promoting the province; Working group to promote the Deputy Prime Minister Ke Kim Yan Fund to support agricultural production of farmers in Banteay Meanchey province.
