"We plan to continue to support the front line doctors of Russian hospitals and other hospitals," he said. We plan to bring some more equipment to the front line doctors in Battambang and Banteay Meanchey. Recently, our company has also helped the poor in the community.
On that occasion, the Director of the Khmer-Soviet Friendship Hospital, Professor Ngy Meng, said that this material has played an important role in the prevention and response of the new Coronavirus (COVID-19) to achieve faster. The company's humanitarian aid is used to respond to the current status of the Kovid 19 virus.
In particular, it contributes to strengthening the emergency response capability not only to the current COVID-19 problem, but to be used whenever there is an outbreak of an infectious disease in the future, as well as contributing to improving the quality of life. Of the Cambodian people.
He also expressed his sincere gratitude and hope that Ruthari Club Phnom Penh Central will continue to provide humanitarian assistance in the near future for Cambodia to promote measures to prevent and respond to the outbreak of Kovid 19 successfully. .
