Mr. Kith Sophal said that under the leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, Samdech has taken great care of the people affected by the COVID-19 epidemic.
The commander confirmed that the gifts brought to the people now, each family received rice, fish sauce, soy sauce, noodles and 3 packets of soap.
