(Phnom Penh): The Judge of the Phnom Penh Municipal Court, Mr. KET Socheat, on the morning of April 24, 2020, held a hearing to announce the verdict and decided to sentence the accused Ven Rachana, alias Thai Srey Neang, to six months imprisonment. Only 2 months and 15 days, the sentence is still suspended.
It should be noted that Ven Rachana, also known as Thai Srey Neang, who was an online seller, was sentenced by the court after the prosecution decided to charge her under Article 38, Article 39 of the Law on "Sexual Business" and Article 249 of the Penal Code. More than 2 months ago.
39-year-old Thai Srey Neang is known as a woman who sells her products online on social media, revealing a number of meat and pornographic places that have been widely criticized. The business woman lives in Toul Kork district, Phnom Penh.
After the woman posted a message criticizing the actions of the authorities and refused to comply with her contract, police forces detained the woman to continue questioning and legal action.
