(Banteay Meanchey): The Poipet City Gendarmerie, led by Brigadier General Nuon Ninaro, on April 23, 2020, sent a suspect for intentional violence to the provincial court for legal action after Received a complaint from the victim, 16-year-old Born Long Kimchhin, on a case of intentional violence around Doeum Putra Market, Kbal Spean 1 Village, Poipet City, Banteay Meanchey Province.
Colonel Nuon Ninaro said that after receiving the complaint, he led the search force to arrest a suspect at 08:30 on April 18, 2020 and bring Come to the Municipal Military Base Command for procedural questioning.
