The provincial governor said that this measure is to prevent the spread of cases of Kovid 19 virus, because this restriction is not to put pressure on the people, but because they do not obey the order of the Royal Government, which does not allow them to return home. And this measure is also for the safety of the person concerned and to avoid any risk to other workers who are working in any factory.
Mr. Kong Sophoan further stated that the provincial administration has already set up a location to wait for people from the district to stay for 14 days and also hope that all people from the district to cooperate with the provincial administration to help. Prevent all, not in the sense of being discriminated against. He says the important thing is to protect everyone, prevent community contagion, prevent regrets and cause tragedy to others working together.
